       2 copy  vpt 0 90 arc
       2 copy moveto
       2 copy  vpt 180 270 arc closepath fill
               vpt 0 360 arc } bind def
/C6 { BL [] 0 setdash 2 copy moveto
      2 copy  vpt 90 270 arc closepath fill
              vpt 0 360 arc closepath } bind def
/C7 { BL [] 0 setdash 2 copy moveto
